WEBVTT

00:00:29.249 --> 00:00:32.959
a perfect one-year-old boy/dinosaur,

00:00:32.983 --> 00:00:34.333
depending on his mood.

00:00:34.944 --> 00:00:38.029
And having a Zach suited me perfectly.

00:00:39.168 --> 00:00:43.191
I had gotten the first job
I applied for in academia,

00:00:43.215 --> 00:00:45.903
land of a thousand crushed dreams.

00:00:46.601 --> 00:00:47.888
And there I was,

00:00:47.912 --> 00:00:49.935
working at my dream job

00:00:49.959 --> 00:00:51.441
with my little baby

00:00:51.465 --> 00:00:54.213
and the man I had imported from Canada.

00:00:54.237 --> 00:00:55.633
(Laughter)

00:00:55.657 --> 00:00:58.635
But a few months before,
I'd started feeling pain in my stomach

00:00:58.659 --> 00:01:01.206
and had gone to every expert
to find out why.